<title>HONG KONG: Lion Asia interim net rises 62.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Lion Asia interim net rises 62.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.3	vs  6.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.77 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    21.69     vs  13.35</p>
<p>    Turnover		     85.38     vs  9.55</p>
<p>    Company name		 Lion Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Lion Asia is a property investment and securities trading group.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of investment properties and includes the realisation of investment property revaluation reserve of HK$3.31 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
